# qwen3.5:2b-q4_K_M-ctx64k — interactive Hermes sessions model.
#
# WHY: Hermes refuses models reporting <64K context for interactive sessions
# (system prompt + memory + skills + conversation need the room). The -ctx16k
# variant (fallback-rung model) fails that floor; this variant reports 64K.
# KV cache math: ~2.8GB total at 64K — fits 4GB VRAM, but tight; verify 100% GPU
# placement after create. If it spills, the fallback is Q8 KV cache or ctx32k
# (below Hermes's floor, so cloud-only for interactive chat).
#
# REBUILD: ollama create qwen3.5:2b-q4_K_M-ctx64k -f config/qwen3.5-2b-q4-ctx64k.Modelfile

FROM qwen3.5:2b-q4_K_M

PARAMETER num_ctx 65536